    "what_en": "When debugging, Claude relies on observed runtime state rather than code reading, keeps a debug journal, tests at least three hypotheses, requires a failing test to lock the fix, then cleans up artifacts.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when you ask to debug crashes, hangs, memory leaks, silent failures, wrong responses, or to reverse-engineer a binary.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "This service crashes on startup; help me debug it.",
        "note": "Starts the hypothesis-driven crash investigation."
      },
      {
        "text": "The API sometimes returns empty with no error; find out why.",
        "note": "It gathers runtime evidence before concluding."
      },
